{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43193","headline":"采莲曲 · 张敬徽","name":"采莲曲","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"游女泛江晴，莲红水复清。\n竞多愁日暮，争疾畏船倾。\n波动疑钗落，风生觉袖轻。\n相看未尽意，归浦櫂歌声。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张敬徽","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43193.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43193","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}